{
  "id": "is-odd",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Tek mi?",
    "en": "Is It Odd?"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.py",
  "solution": "solution.py",
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Tek sayının 2'ye bölümünden kalan 1: `return n % 2 == 1`.",
      "en": "An odd number leaves 1 when divided by 2: `return n % 2 == 1`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef main():\n    n = int(input(\"n: \"))\n    if is_odd(n):\n        print(\"Odd\")\n    else:\n        print(\"Even\")\n\n\ndef is_odd(n):\n    return n % 2 == 1\n\n\nmain()\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef main():\n    n = int(input(\"n: \"))\n    if is_odd(n):\n        print(\"Odd\")\n    else:\n        print(\"Even\")\n\n\ndef is_odd(n):\n    return n % 2 == 1\n\n\nmain()\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "stdio",
      "cases": [
        {
          "stdin": "7\n",
          "stdout": "Odd"
        },
        {
          "stdin": "10\n",
          "stdout": "Even"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "is_odd",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [
            3
          ],
          "returns": true
        },
        {
          "args": [
            4
          ],
          "returns": false
        },
        {
          "args": [
            0
          ],
          "returns": false
        },
        {
          "args": [
            -5
          ],
          "returns": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
